  "body": "It doesn't make much sense for each of the encoding algorithms to define equivalent processing for it.\r\n\r\nDoing something similar for `<input type=file>` might be warranted, though that's a little more special.\r\n\r\nIf we make this change we'll need to coordinate it with the URL Standard.",
